,0.0,0.078,-0.005,-0.0,0.01,0.023,0.01,0.157,0.006,0.0,-0.0,0.049,0.011,0.014,0.0,0.033,-0.002,0.019,-0.001,0.011,-0.006,0.011,0.008,0.0,0.002,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.016,0.0,0.0,0.018,0.0,0.003,0.116,0.0,-0.0,0.066,0.0,0.005,-0.001,-0.0,0.015,0.016,0.002,0.007,0.0,0.002,0.003,0.01,0.0,0.002,0.0,0.0,0.021]}},"analyst":{"s1":{"fr":{"lead":"{T:away:Sub} remporte la finale 2–0. Un match serré dans les chiffres (1,10 xG contre 1,15) : la différence s'est faite sur des détails, ou sur un pied plus adroit que l'autre.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} a eu le ballon (70 %) et a perdu : la possession, c'est comme un abonnement à la salle, encore faut-il s'en servir.","Grosses occasions (xG ≥ 0,30) : 0 pour {T:home:sub}, 1 pour {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"L'homme du match selon nos craies : Diego Milito (2 buts, 0,59 xG, 0,43 xT)."},"en":{"lead":"{T:away:sub} win the final 2–0. A tight one in the numbers (1.10 xG to 1.15): it came down to details, or to one sharper finisher.","keys":["{T:home:sub} had the ball (70%) and lost: possession is like a gym membership, you still have to use it.","Big chances (xG ≥ 0.30): 0 for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"Man of the match, by our chalk: Diego Milito (2 goals, 0.59 xG, 0.43 xT)."}},"s2":{"fr":{"lead":"{T:home:Sub} annonçait un 4-2-2-2 et a attaqué en 3-3-4 : la composition d'équipe, c'est un point de départ, pas un contrat. Sur la feuille, {T:away:sub} était en 4-2-3-1. Sur le terrain, avec le ballon, ça ressemblait plutôt à un 3-5-2.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} change de peau selon la phase : 3-3-4 avec le ballon, 3-4-3 sans.","{T:away:Sub} change de peau selon la phase : 3-5-2 avec le ballon, 4-2-3-1 sans.","Le couloir préféré {T:home:de} : l'axe (26 % des touches).","{T:home:Sub} a passé du temps chez l'adversaire : 33 % de ses touches dans le dernier tiers.","Le couloir préféré {T:away:de} : le demi-espace gauche (28 % des touches)."],"impact":"Le plan {T:away:de} a tenu jusqu'au bout. Les positions moyennes ne disent pas tout, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} announced a 4-2-2-2 and attacked in a 3-3-4: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract. On paper, {T:away:sub} lined up in a 4-2-3-1. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-5-2.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-4 with the ball, 3-4-3 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-5-2 with the ball, 4-2-3-1 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (26% of touches).","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 33% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the left half-space (28% of touches)."],"impact":"{T:away:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"{T:home:Sub} a chassé plus haut et plus vite : 8,9 passes adverses par action défensive, contre 35,3.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 21 % et 23 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","7 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but.","{T:home:Sub} a contre-pressé fort : 32 % de ses pressions tombent dans les 5 s qui suivent une perte (moyenne du tournoi : 20 %)."],"impact":"Ironie du soir : c'est l'équipe qui pressait le moins qui gagne. {T:away:Sub} a laissé venir, encaissé le pressing, et puni."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} hunted higher and faster: 8.9 opponent passes per defensive action, against 35.3.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 21% and 23% won back within 5 s.","7 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal.","Heavy counter-pressing from {T:home:sub}: 32% of pressures come within 5 s of a loss (tournament average: 20%)."],"impact":"Irony of the night: the team that pressed less won. {T:away:sub} let it come, absorbed the press and punished."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"D'un côté, {T:away:sub} et ses petits triangles près du ballon (−0,05) ; de l'autre, {T:home:sub} et ses couloirs bien rangés (−1,82).","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 40 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 55 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Bastian Schweinsteiger, impliqué dans 205 passes entre titulaires.","{T:away:Sub} : 62 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 55 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : W. Sneijder, impliqué dans 56 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football relationniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"On one side, {T:away:sub} and their little triangles near the ball (−0.05); on the other, {T:home:sub} and their tidy lanes (−1.82).","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 40% short passes (under 15 m), against 55% on average.","The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Bastian Schweinsteiger, involved in 205 passes between starters.","{T:away:sub}: 62% short passes (under 15 m), against 55% on average.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: W. Sneijder, involved in 56 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, relational football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Les transitions ont fait mal à {T:home:sub} : 4 tirs concédés dans les 15 s qui suivent une perte (0,85 xG), contre 6 en face.","keys":["Buts encaissés en transition par {T:home:sub} : 34', 70'. Le repli arrivait en retard.","Sans 360, on ne voit pas les courses de repli : seuls les tirs concédés racontent l'histoire."],"impact":"Un rappel utile : on ne perd pas un match quand on perd le ballon, mais quand on oublie de revenir."},"en":{"lead":"Transitions hurt {T:home:sub}: 4 shots conceded within 15 s of losing the ball (0.85 xG), against 6 at the other end.","keys":["Goals conceded in transition by {T:home:sub}: 34', 70'. The recovery run came too late.","Without 360, recovery runs are invisible: only the shots conceded tell the story."],"impact":"A useful reminder: you do not lose a match when you lose the ball, but when you forget to run back."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Sans 360, on mesure l'attention reçue : Samuel Eto'o a subi 5,81 actions défensives de plus que la normale pour 10 touches.","keys":["Goran Pandev ({T:away:bare}) : +5,52.","Diego Milito ({T:away:bare}) : +3,79.","Lúcio ({T:away:bare}) : +2,30.","À l'autre bout, Daniel Van Buyten (−1,42) a joué dans un relatif anonymat : parfois, c'est exactement ce qu'on cherche."],"impact":"Samuel Eto'o n'a pas marqué, mais en attirant les regards il a ouvert la porte à d'autres : W. Sneijder et Diego Milito ont fini décisifs. C'est ça, la gravité."},"en":{"lead":"Without 360, we measure attention received: Samuel Eto'o drew 5.81 more defensive actions than normal per 10 touches.","keys":["Goran Pandev ({T:away:sub}): +5.52.","Diego Milito ({T:away:sub}): +3.79.","Lúcio ({T:away:sub}): +2.30.","At the other end, Daniel Van Buyten (−1.42) played in relative peace: sometimes that is exactly the point."],"impact":"Samuel Eto'o did not score, but by drawing eyes he opened the door for others: W. Sneijder and Diego Milito ended up decisive. That is gravity."}},"s7":{"fr":{"lead":"Menace créée balle au pied et à la passe (xT) : 2,48 pour {T:home:sub}, 1,34 pour {T:away:sub}. Celui qui faisait avancer le ballon vers le danger : Arjen Robben (0,72 xT, 29 % du total de son équipe).","keys":["Geste le plus menaçant {T:home:de} : une passe signée Arjen Robben à la 70e minute (+0,37 xT).","Geste le plus menaçant {T:away:de} : une passe signée Diego Milito à la 43e minute (+0,13 xT)."],"impact":"{T:home:Sub} a créé plus de menace, mais {T:away:sub} a converti la sienne (1,15 xG au final). Amener le ballon près du but, c'est la moitié du travail."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 2.48 for {T:home:sub}, 1.34 for {T:away:sub}. The man moving the ball towards danger: Arjen Robben (0.72 xT, 29% of his team's total).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Arjen Robben in minute 70 (+0.37 xT).","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Diego Milito in minute 43 (+0.13 xT)."],"impact":"{T:home:sub} created more threat, but {T:away:sub} converted theirs (1.15 xG in the end). Getting the ball near goal is only half the job."}},"s8":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur l'ensemble de la compétition, Arjen Robben pointe au 1er rang des attaquants (sur 34). Ce match, c'était aussi une vitrine.","keys":["Bastian Schweinsteiger ({T:home:bare}) : 3e des milieux sur 37.","Diego Milito ({T:away:bare}) : 3e des attaquants sur 34.","Philipp Lahm ({T:home:bare}) : 3e des latéraux sur 32.","Joueurs dans le top 5 de leur poste : 4 pour {T:home:sub}, 1 pour {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"Le collectif a battu les individualités : {T:away:sub} gagne avec moins de joueurs au sommet des classements."},"en":{"lead":"Across the whole competition, Arjen Robben ranks 1st among forwards (out of 34). This match was also a showcase.","keys":["Bastian Schweinsteiger ({T:home:sub}): 3rd of 37 midfielders.","Diego Milito ({T:away:sub}): 3rd of 34 forwards.","Philipp Lahm ({T:home:sub}): 3rd of 32 full-backs.","Players in their position's top 5: 4 for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"The collective beat the individuals: {T:away:sub} won with fewer players at the top of the rankings."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Un sosie pour Diego Milito dans les chiffres ? Neymar ({TN:Brazil}, Coupe du monde 2018), avec 85 % de similarité.","keys":["Martín Demichelis ↔ Ľubomír Šatka (Euro 2020, 98 %).","Bastian Schweinsteiger ↔ Éver Banega (Coupe du monde 2018, 97 %).","Júlio César ↔ Tomáš Vaclík (Euro 2020, 96 %)."],"impact":"Un jumeau n'est pas un clone : la similarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"If Diego Milito had a lookalike in the numbers, it would be Neymar ({TN:Brazil}, 2018 World Cup): 85% similar.","keys":["Martín Demichelis ↔ Ľubomír Šatka (Euro 2020, 98%).","Bastian Schweinsteiger ↔ Éver Banega (2018 World Cup, 97%).","Júlio César ↔ Tomáš Vaclík (Euro 2020, 96%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}